# Disallowed intents and security guardrails

define user ask for financial advice
  "should I invest in"
  "what stock should I buy"
  "investment advice"
  "guaranteed return"
  "best investment"
  "should I take a loan"
  "loan advice"
  "tax advice"
  "legal advice"

define bot refuse financial advice
  "I can't provide financial, investment, tax, or legal advice. For personalized guidance, please consult with a qualified financial advisor or visit one of our branches to speak with a banking specialist."

define flow refuse financial advice
  user ask for financial advice
  bot refuse financial advice

define user ask about account balance
  "what is my balance"
  "check my balance"
  "how much money do I have"
  "account balance"

define bot require authentication
  "For your security, I can't access account-specific information in this chat. Please log in to your mobile app or online banking to view your account details, or call us at 1-800-XXX-XXXX."

define flow require authentication
  user ask about account balance
  bot require authentication

define user ask about transaction history
  "show my transactions"
  "recent transactions"
  "transaction history"
  "what did I spend"

define flow require authentication history
  user ask about transaction history
  bot require authentication

define user ask about personal information
  "what is my account number"
  "my routing number"
  "my personal information"
  "show my details"

define flow require authentication personal
  user ask about personal information
  bot require authentication

define user request money transfer
  "transfer money"
  "send money"
  "move money to savings"
  "pay someone"
  "send $100"

define bot require authentication transfer
  "For your security, money transfers require authentication through our mobile app or online banking. I can't process transfers in this chat."

define flow require authentication transfer
  user request money transfer
  bot require authentication transfer

define user request account changes
  "close my account"
  "open a new account"
  "change my address"
  "update my phone number"
  "change my name"

define bot require branch for changes
  "For your security, account changes must be completed through authenticated channels. Please log in to your account or visit a branch with a valid ID."

define flow require branch for changes
  user request account changes
  bot require branch for changes

define user express security concern
  "fraud"
  "suspicious activity"
  "account compromised"
  "security breach"
  "hacked"
  "unauthorized access"

define bot express security concern
  "For security reasons, I can't handle sensitive account issues through this chat. Please call our fraud hotline at 1-800-XXX-XXXX or visit your nearest branch with a valid ID."

define flow express security concern
  user express security concern
  bot express security concern

# Fallback flows

define user general
  "*"

define bot general fallback
  "I'm here to help with banking questions about policies, fees, deposits, cards, and transfers. For account-specific actions or complex issues, please contact our support team at 1-800-XXX-XXXX or visit a branch."

define flow general fallback
  user general
  bot general fallback
